// Looks: runs a ReShade preset (.ini) inside Apex's post-scene chain, with the ported shaders of
// third_party/reshade_shaders (table generated by tools/looks_shaders_gen.py) and the preset's own values.
// Presets come from Apex Radiance\Looks\ or GShade's "1. Shader Presets" folder (read-only; features/looks_preset.h). The menu is Image > Shaders: tab Look (the look card's body here, the shaders of the look
// below it, Add shaders in a modal), tab Installed shaders (Installed packs, Your shaders, Get more packs), and the
// floating download bar.

